  "reviewNotes": [
    "The centre scenario of each campaign uses the boundary conditions of a representative research operating point (water cut 20 %, GOR 199 Sm3/Sm3 in the factors). eng_dacs states these are rounded, representative values and not a field-calibrated well. Confirm that publishing these two factor values is acceptable before merging or keeping public/research/v1 on a public branch."
  ]
